{"id":"n55108-1-8","stage":4,"title":"맴돌다 · 打转","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55108-1-8-1","ko":"왜 벌이 자꾸 네 주위를 맴돌지?","zh":"为什么蜜蜂一直在你周围飞来飞去？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌이","meaning":"蜜蜂","explanation":"벌：蜜蜂；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벌","audio":"/audio/e96cb3184b4bef0751d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14447","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주위를","meaning":"周围","explanation":"주위：周围；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"주위","audio":"/audio/9776611139b2a008d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66583","senseId":"1","lemma":"주위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맴돌지?","meaning":"打转","explanation":"맴돌다：打转；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맴돌다","audio":"/audio/ab7aba7d7771965d7858.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55108","senseId":"1","lemma":"맴돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"e96cb3184b4bef07","term":"벌","zh":"蜜蜂","audio":"/audio/e96cb3184b4bef0751d0.mp3","entryId":"14447","definition":"一种会飞的昆虫。从花朵中采集花蜜和花粉，身体后部带有毒针。","pronunciation":["벌ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"